WEBVTT

00:01.890 --> 00:03.700
Grim Reaper, what's with those ears?

00:03.700 --> 00:05.230
We finally meet.

00:05.230 --> 00:07.190
Odessa Ei is really happy?

00:07.190 --> 00:08.690
Who the hell are you?!

00:09.220 --> 00:12.060
It's a waste to end this in an instant.

00:12.060 --> 00:14.940
I'll kill you in the most painful way.

00:14.940 --> 00:15.990
Onee-chan!

00:19.050 --> 00:21.760
Why do you call me a sister?

00:22.120 --> 00:25.170
Wow, this is interesting. You don't remember anything, eh?

00:26.670 --> 00:29.870
After that, I'll shred you to pieces.

01:51.670 --> 01:57.380
This anime is a story about *BEEP* featuring
a super-pretty girl, Kyouka-sama, and her family.

02:17.920 --> 02:18.990
Watch out, Kyouka.

02:25.740 --> 02:27.080
Grim Reaper!

02:27.080 --> 02:29.060
Or rather, who are you?!

02:29.060 --> 02:30.580
Odessa-sama.

02:31.060 --> 02:31.990
Who is it?

02:33.260 --> 02:33.840
Damn.

02:33.840 --> 02:36.090
You must control yourself, Odessa-sama.

02:36.090 --> 02:40.200
You nosy gramps! Blockhead! You should just die!

02:41.140 --> 02:42.090
Grim Reaper!

02:44.840 --> 02:46.470
What had happened to me?

02:47.580 --> 02:49.430
Odessa Ei won't go home.

02:50.420 --> 02:51.980
It's that voice again.

02:52.440 --> 02:54.820
Odessa Ei will beat Onee-chan.

02:54.820 --> 02:56.940
Otherwise, I can't move on.

02:56.940 --> 02:58.650
What exactly are you?!

03:01.030 --> 03:01.860
Wait!

03:02.280 --> 03:03.200
Kyouka!

03:07.240 --> 03:09.770
First of all, let's get out of here.

03:09.770 --> 03:11.890
You're as stupid as ever.

03:12.500 --> 03:17.760
They are after me. If we get out of here,
the next place they'll come after is our home.

03:18.670 --> 03:20.380
So we'll beat her here.

03:21.630 --> 03:26.560
Grim Reaper! Who is this Odessa Ei?
I'll have you tell us everything you know!

03:33.030 --> 03:35.810
It started around the time I returned to this city.

03:36.360 --> 03:40.070
That's when I started to hear that Odessa Ei's voice.

03:40.070 --> 03:44.680
If all your actions were due to being controlled by Odessa Ei,

03:45.030 --> 03:50.370
then like Kyouka, she must be able to sneak into
other people's central nervous system and take over.

03:50.370 --> 03:57.170
To lure me into this trap-filled amusement park,
she used you to seduce Ouka.

03:57.170 --> 04:00.870
I wanted to meet Ouka-san and find out the truth; that's the true feeling I had.

04:00.870 --> 04:02.480
She took advantage of that.

04:02.480 --> 04:03.710
Talk about trouble.

04:03.710 --> 04:08.430
Because you've done whatever it is that caused her to pursue you, both Ouka-san and I are getting pulled in.

04:08.430 --> 04:10.230
Are you sure you don't remember anything?

04:10.230 --> 04:15.690
It's coming from someone underhanded like you.
Maybe you tried to kill me using the chance you got.

04:15.690 --> 04:17.500
Stop it, Kyouka.

04:17.500 --> 04:20.500
Grim Reaper had rabbit ears on her head at the time.

04:20.500 --> 04:23.460
I don't think her being manipulated is a lie.

04:23.460 --> 04:24.360
Ouka-san~

04:28.700 --> 04:31.500
But where could the real body be?

04:31.910 --> 04:35.830
There's no chance of winning if the opponent fights only when she's parasiting others.

04:35.830 --> 04:38.270
Welcome to Slave War Amusement Park!

04:38.270 --> 04:39.750
I'm the mascot here, Slave-kun!

04:39.750 --> 04:42.970
There are 150 Slave-kuns at this amusement park.

04:42.970 --> 04:46.240
They walk around aimlessly and make the customers anxious for no reason.

04:46.240 --> 04:47.640
What a horrible mascot.

04:47.640 --> 04:51.910
There is this black type Slave-kun and a white type.

04:48.350 --> 04:49.330
PLACEHOLDER

04:48.350 --> 04:49.330
Nice to meet you.

04:49.870 --> 04:50.900
PLACEHOLDER

04:49.870 --> 04:50.900
Hi.

04:51.910 --> 04:53.490
PLACEHOLDER

04:51.910 --> 04:53.490
Ready fight!

04:52.220 --> 04:56.210
They fight each other, and the number gradually falls.

04:56.210 --> 04:59.190
If you find any problems, let us know.

04:56.210 --> 04:57.590
PLACEHOLDER

04:56.210 --> 04:57.590
They're called Black Slaves.

04:59.580 --> 05:02.290
Make sure you don't ask anything of the White Slaves.

05:02.290 --> 05:03.770
They're your enemy.

05:03.770 --> 05:07.490
Enemy... Enemy... enemy... enemyenemyenemyenemyenemy...

05:05.990 --> 05:08.000
I think it's best to get away.

05:09.120 --> 05:12.280
Are there any normal robots at this amusement park?!

05:14.290 --> 05:16.320
Welcome to Slave War Amusement Park!

05:15.450 --> 05:16.320
Kick.

05:16.320 --> 05:17.170
Punch.

05:17.170 --> 05:18.080
Cut.

05:20.470 --> 05:22.430
Odessa Ei is having problems?

05:22.430 --> 05:24.950
They're too strong individually.

05:24.950 --> 05:26.980
But Oddesa Ei won't lose?

05:26.980 --> 05:31.300
Onee-chan, I'll shred that ugly lump of meat you're wearing.

05:31.300 --> 05:32.430
Iron Fist Judgment!

05:33.350 --> 05:35.480
All your attacks are too simple!

05:35.480 --> 05:39.870
Unlike humans, you guys charge in without fear,
but it's boring if you're this weak!

05:40.730 --> 05:42.730
It doesn't hurt for the enemies to be weak.

05:42.730 --> 05:44.460
Hello! Let's play.

05:43.900 --> 05:45.530
I will destroy your face.

05:45.530 --> 05:47.200
Let's play together.

05:47.670 --> 05:49.000
Off I go!

05:51.120 --> 05:54.040
When you two cooperate, no enemy can stand before you.

05:54.580 --> 05:59.980
Dear Lord, I swear next time to use this cat-like creature as a shield first.

05:59.980 --> 06:02.570
I, as a god, shall answer your confession.

06:02.570 --> 06:04.200
"Die!"

06:05.050 --> 06:09.830
During the fight, I got the impression of grenades flying at me more often than not.

06:09.830 --> 06:13.140
You must have a pheromone that attracts weapons.

06:13.230 --> 06:15.470
Do you want to find out the color of your brain that much?!

06:17.930 --> 06:19.160
PLACEHOLDER

06:17.930 --> 06:19.160
A Ferris wheel.

06:18.400 --> 06:20.600
How about a little Ferris wheel ride?

06:21.690 --> 06:23.560
Ferris wheel?!

06:24.950 --> 06:29.490
The one who picks the red marked tab gets to go on with Ouka-san first for a lovey-dovey ride.

06:29.490 --> 06:32.240
We three can ride together.

06:29.490 --> 06:32.240
Eeny meeny miny mo...

06:32.240 --> 06:33.370
Never!

06:37.160 --> 06:38.660
I win!

06:38.660 --> 06:40.680
I bet you cheated!

06:40.680 --> 06:43.890
I feel a bond between Ouka-san and me.

06:43.890 --> 06:45.450
Round and round we go!

06:46.440 --> 06:48.560
Try to lay a finger on Ouka!

06:48.560 --> 06:59.990
I'll break your fingers one at a time, then yank out all your teeth, then poke every hole you got!

06:57.930 --> 07:00.980
That burglar cat's face is getting further and further away.

07:02.400 --> 07:07.030
A world mystery. Whether you look at her from
up close or far away, she's got a complete idiot's face.

07:08.030 --> 07:13.320
You two hate each other, yet is it my imagination to think that you two are actually getting along?

07:17.950 --> 07:20.960
I'll kill them if they're flirting.

07:20.960 --> 07:23.550
But wow, how sweet I've become.

07:23.550 --> 07:27.580
If nutrition facts were written on my back,
I wouldn't be surprised to see "sugar" included.

07:30.840 --> 07:33.730
It's a waste to end this in an instant.

07:33.730 --> 07:36.760
I'll kill you in the most painful way.

07:36.760 --> 07:40.100
But where could the real body be?

07:40.100 --> 07:44.310
There's no chance of winning if the opponent fights only when she's parasiting others.

07:46.690 --> 07:51.430
I was thinking of getting all cuddly with you once we were alone,

07:52.070 --> 07:59.580
but if you think about it, it's a waste of time to tease that burglar cat.

08:00.260 --> 08:03.730
So this is a wish that I ask for.

08:03.730 --> 08:04.790
Ouka-san.

08:04.790 --> 08:05.460
Yes?

08:06.270 --> 08:08.670
Please kiss me.

08:12.240 --> 08:13.470
I...

08:27.310 --> 08:28.770
Grim Reaper?

08:30.690 --> 08:31.860
Double suicide?

08:31.860 --> 08:33.030
Ouka!

08:37.410 --> 08:38.770
I won't let him die!

08:39.410 --> 08:39.990
What?

08:44.500 --> 08:45.500
Are you all right?

08:46.020 --> 08:47.340
Yes, I suppose.

08:47.340 --> 08:49.170
It's Odessa Ei's doing.

08:49.170 --> 08:52.010
I thought you were trying to do a double suicide.

08:54.070 --> 08:55.010
You...

08:55.010 --> 08:57.010
My name is Suiar.

08:57.010 --> 08:58.470
Suiar?

08:58.470 --> 09:02.640
Please don't worry. My body can be replaced.

09:02.640 --> 09:04.480
I'm not worried about you.

09:04.480 --> 09:06.980
Rather than that, what do you know about me?

09:06.980 --> 09:08.980
Tell me, who am I?!

09:08.980 --> 09:12.900
Where was I born? How was I called? Why was I thrown away?

09:12.900 --> 09:15.180
Why was I in that underground world?!

09:16.970 --> 09:19.430
You have... You have committed an...

09:19.430 --> 09:20.330
Out with it.

09:20.330 --> 09:24.710
...committed an unforgivable sin.

09:24.710 --> 09:25.330
Suiar!

09:28.080 --> 09:30.370
Suiar, am I a monster?

09:30.370 --> 09:33.210
Am I a monster like you guys?

09:36.470 --> 09:37.300
Horsey.

09:37.300 --> 09:37.970
Horsey.

09:42.860 --> 09:43.640
Kyouka!

09:44.850 --> 09:45.890
Kyouka!

09:45.890 --> 09:47.450
It's dangerous to stay here.

09:51.610 --> 09:53.980
There's a haunted house there.

09:51.610 --> 09:52.540
Haunted house.

09:59.280 --> 10:00.740
Kyouka! Grim Reaper!

10:00.740 --> 10:01.950
Don't come, Ouka!

10:01.950 --> 10:03.060
Kyouka!

10:03.060 --> 10:05.630
If you're the head of the family, think rationally!

10:05.630 --> 10:06.790
I will kill you if you come down here!

10:06.790 --> 10:08.060
Kyouka!

10:11.060 --> 10:12.960
Where are you, Odessa Ei!

10:21.850 --> 10:23.120
Must be the control room.

10:36.560 --> 10:37.560
Damn it.

10:37.560 --> 10:40.770
Don't think you can keep doing whatever you want with me.

10:40.770 --> 10:42.780
I keep on falling down today.

10:43.260 --> 10:45.170
Looks like a dumpster.

10:45.170 --> 10:47.510
Can you break the wall with your grenades?

10:48.290 --> 10:50.910
I used them up in the last battle.

10:51.490 --> 10:54.540
Plus this wall won't budge at all with grenades.

10:54.540 --> 10:57.440
I wouldn't like to die here with you.

10:57.440 --> 11:00.050
What kind of asshole has a grudge against you?

11:00.050 --> 11:03.120
They were Odessa Ei and Suiar, right?

11:03.120 --> 11:06.490
I don't mind this frenzy act,
but I'd like more explanation myself.

11:06.490 --> 11:08.060
I can't possibly have fun with this.

11:10.250 --> 11:13.080
I wish we could have met under different circumstances.

11:14.210 --> 11:18.330
I hate to admit it, but being with you is fun.

11:18.330 --> 11:23.910
It just happened to cross my mind.
Now I understand Ouka-san's feelings a little.

11:23.910 --> 11:26.050
What is this sudden change of attitude?

11:26.050 --> 11:29.990
Don't get the wrong idea; I do hate you.

11:30.340 --> 11:33.200
But I happen to be pretty strong,

11:33.200 --> 11:38.170
so I'm happy to find someone like you,
who I can't crush even if I fight with my very best.

11:38.170 --> 11:39.350
That's all.

11:40.470 --> 11:43.760
Let's quit that. Or else I won't be able to fight you.

11:44.420 --> 11:48.140
It's best if we hate and detest each other.

11:48.140 --> 11:50.140
You started the conversation.

11:51.510 --> 11:53.520
I love Ouka-san.

11:53.520 --> 11:58.020
So if you make his life miserable, I will destroy your face.

11:58.020 --> 11:59.400
Grim Reaper...

12:01.860 --> 12:03.910
The walls are moving in.

12:05.580 --> 12:07.910
Just like a third-rate action movie.

12:08.700 --> 12:10.410
Where are you going?

12:10.410 --> 12:13.460
I think we shouldn't leave things as they stand.

12:13.460 --> 12:16.880
Strangely enough, no conflict came up amongst us until now.

12:17.450 --> 12:20.390
A normal family can't get along this well.

12:20.390 --> 12:23.670
It's very unnatural. It's bound to break one day.

12:23.970 --> 12:24.840
Teika...

12:24.840 --> 12:29.680
One day, the family will naturally come to awkwardness and bring about uneasiness, like today.

12:29.680 --> 12:31.600
It's a matter of sooner or later.

12:34.440 --> 12:36.450
Don't worry, Hyouka.

12:36.450 --> 12:39.440
The Midarezaki won't break that easily.

12:44.430 --> 12:45.690
What are you doing?!

12:45.690 --> 12:46.610
Watch out!

12:48.740 --> 12:49.830
I was too late.

12:50.460 --> 12:56.620
Odessa-sama must have taken over the computer, set traps, and attacked you all.

12:56.620 --> 12:57.580
And you are?

12:58.110 --> 13:03.110
I am Odessa-sama's chief educator, Suiar Recklessness.

13:03.110 --> 13:05.800
So you're the one who saved us earlier?

13:05.800 --> 13:09.930
We're demons that live on the boundary of dreams and reality.

13:11.560 --> 13:16.810
We demons do not have bodies like you. We exist only as souls.

13:16.810 --> 13:21.250
Spirit parasites that take over the bodies of others and govern them.

13:21.250 --> 13:22.820
So those ears are, in other words...

13:22.820 --> 13:25.700
Yes. Your wife is a demon.

13:25.700 --> 13:26.720
Demon?

13:26.720 --> 13:27.660
Kyouka is?

13:28.740 --> 13:33.370
If Kyouka finds that out...
Or, she might already have an idea.

13:33.370 --> 13:35.000
Vanessa-sama was...

13:35.410 --> 13:41.340
Well, she was called Kyoukya-sama
in the underground world, and Kyouka-sama here,

13:41.340 --> 13:44.490
But Vanessa-sama used to be
the Queen of the demon world.

13:44.840 --> 13:49.680
However, she committed the sin of wishing to become human.

13:50.460 --> 13:54.250
The opposition faction followed Vanessa-sama to the underground world to erase her memory,

13:54.250 --> 13:58.690
so the existence of the demon world would not be leaked to humans.

13:59.140 --> 14:01.750
The successor to the throne is Odessa-sama.

14:02.190 --> 14:07.970
However, no matter how hard Odessa-sama tried, she kept being compared to her charismatic sister.

14:07.970 --> 14:09.860
Kyouka was a charismatic queen, huh?

14:09.860 --> 14:15.370
Odessa-sama believes that the current situation can be changed by winning against Vanessa-sama.

14:15.370 --> 14:19.440
However it is a sin to come into this world.

14:19.440 --> 14:24.380
If others find out she's here,
she will lose more than what she has.

14:25.380 --> 14:27.100
Let's stop her at all costs.

14:27.100 --> 14:28.680
We need to stop both of them.

14:28.680 --> 14:30.970
Both Kyouka and Odessa-san deserve to be saved.

14:30.970 --> 14:36.980
The dispersed pieces of my soul are currently searching for Vanessa-sama.

14:38.340 --> 14:42.480
I wonder what it is that keeps us with them knowing that it will only bring us trouble.

14:44.930 --> 14:52.380
My ideals and joy I thought incomprehensible were understood for the first time in a world I have nothing to do with.

14:52.380 --> 14:54.870
What a strange bond of fate.

14:55.350 --> 14:58.120
I expected myself to die in a miserable way,

14:58.120 --> 15:02.630
but I guess I'm going to get crushed to death with a cute little girl.

15:02.630 --> 15:04.130
How can you stay seated like that?

15:04.130 --> 15:06.090
I'm not called Grim Reaper for nothing.

15:06.090 --> 15:09.550
I was ready to face death the moment I put this mask on.

15:09.550 --> 15:11.740
If you want to die, then go ahead!

15:11.740 --> 15:14.570
I won't die! I won't let myself die here!

15:14.570 --> 15:15.930
My children are waiting at home.

15:17.680 --> 15:20.990
I will solve the problem magnificently like always,

15:20.990 --> 15:24.940
and they believe that I will bring the peaceful yet frenzy daily life back with me!

15:24.940 --> 15:26.110
I will not die!

15:26.110 --> 15:29.660
I can't die in this heap of trash without knowing who I am!

15:29.660 --> 15:31.610
Don't take my lightly, Odessa Ei!

15:33.030 --> 15:36.110
Grim Reaper, you said you were ready to die, didn't you?

15:36.110 --> 15:39.790
Then hold on to your life for a second and offer up that life to me!

15:40.520 --> 15:43.420
If it's my life you want, use it as you like, shit girl.

15:45.260 --> 15:46.880
Thanks, puke girl.

15:46.880 --> 15:50.550
Rest assured. As a most wonderful fact, I, Kyouka-sama, am omniscient and omnipotent!

15:52.650 --> 15:55.530
Humans hold back their strength subconsciously.

15:55.530 --> 16:00.310
If the block is taken out, their physical abilities will increase six or seven fold.

16:00.310 --> 16:03.130
With your trained body, it should be able to break through this wall.

16:03.650 --> 16:06.260
You want to take over my body?

16:06.260 --> 16:08.150
What a disgusting thought.

16:08.150 --> 16:10.400
What are you going to do if you become incapable of getting out of me?

16:10.400 --> 16:12.540
It's a disgusting thought to me, too, but it's give and take.

16:12.540 --> 16:14.410
If I can't get out...

16:16.910 --> 16:19.910
...then I'll return to my family in your body.

16:21.910 --> 16:24.930
So at least this body gets to become Ouka-san's wife.

16:24.930 --> 16:26.210
That might not be too bad.

16:26.260 --> 16:29.050
Time for the party to start! Dance, Grim Reaper!

17:02.160 --> 17:05.620
If you had to have an ugly face,
you should have gotten a more hilarious one.

17:06.620 --> 17:11.050
A gruesome scar like that won't let anyone laugh even if they wanted to, fool.

17:12.430 --> 17:13.460
What was that for?

17:16.090 --> 17:17.090
You!

17:17.090 --> 17:20.630
I thought I had you for sure. Odessa Ei is surprised?

17:20.630 --> 17:22.430
Perfect timing for you to show up.

17:22.430 --> 17:25.370
I was in the mood to smack you in the face.

17:26.100 --> 17:28.390
This pain belongs to me.

17:28.390 --> 17:31.380
Even every drop of blood. Isn't that so?

17:32.480 --> 17:35.700
The owner of this body is Midarezaki Kyouka.

17:37.360 --> 17:39.070
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

17:39.640 --> 17:43.050
Anxiety is like insects. No matter how many you crush, they keep coming back out.

17:43.050 --> 17:45.370
Don't question! Don't think twice! That's what commoners do!

17:45.370 --> 17:48.110
I don't care who I am!
I can be a monster or slug for all I care!

17:48.110 --> 17:50.960
There is no difference in the fact that I am who I am!

17:50.960 --> 17:52.960
You're so strong, Onee-chan.

17:52.960 --> 17:55.700
But you can't beat me.

17:56.130 --> 17:58.890
Because you don't want to kill this person.

17:59.970 --> 18:02.970
You're not following through with your punches.

18:02.970 --> 18:07.320
With attacks like that, you can't stop me.

18:08.850 --> 18:09.850
A feint?

18:11.350 --> 18:14.650
I only took over her mind and allowed her combat ability free reign.

18:18.480 --> 18:21.160
Yay! Idiot! You fell for it!

18:21.160 --> 18:23.030
Now I have surpassed Onee-chan!

18:23.030 --> 18:24.540
If I were to lose against you...

18:24.540 --> 18:26.310
I've won!

18:26.310 --> 18:29.040
Now I won't let anyone say anything towards me.

18:35.630 --> 18:36.630
Ouka!

18:40.890 --> 18:42.140
Odessa-sama!

18:46.640 --> 18:48.290
Don't look!

18:49.520 --> 18:50.770
Don't look!

18:54.190 --> 18:55.280
Ouka!

19:02.270 --> 19:04.950
Why? Why? Why?

19:06.010 --> 19:07.830
"Why" you ask?

19:07.880 --> 19:09.920
Is your brain rotted through?

19:09.920 --> 19:11.330
If you don't get it, then I'll spell it out for you.

19:12.080 --> 19:14.400
You don't love Ouka!

19:14.400 --> 19:16.750
You just don't want Ouka to hate you!

19:24.680 --> 19:26.720
You don't want Ouka to see your ugly face.

19:27.420 --> 19:31.310
Your selfish thought even beat Odessa Ei and hurt Ouka!

19:31.810 --> 19:33.620
So what if you have an ugly face.

19:33.620 --> 19:35.780
Would Ouka insult you about it?

19:35.780 --> 19:37.100
Even if you're a monster...

19:37.400 --> 19:40.320
Would Ouka hate you for that?

19:40.320 --> 19:44.450
How could you claim you love Ouka when you don't even know that?

19:44.450 --> 19:47.960
Kyouka, are you saying that to yourself?

19:49.450 --> 19:51.370
Ouka, you're concious?

19:52.450 --> 19:55.080
Yeah, since you were so loud right by my ears.

19:55.080 --> 19:57.700
I could knock you out again, you know?

20:05.050 --> 20:06.890
Odessa Ei is disappointed?

20:06.890 --> 20:11.990
That's what Onee-chan gained
at the cost of casting away her kind?

20:11.990 --> 20:15.350
Odessa-sama, perhaps you were actually jealous?

20:15.350 --> 20:18.860
Yes. Hate is the opposite of adoration.

20:18.860 --> 20:20.960
No, it isn't!

20:20.960 --> 20:22.360
Odessa Ei won't lose?!

20:22.360 --> 20:24.430
I won't lose to Onee-chan!

20:24.430 --> 20:27.640
So I will return to the land of demons and work to become a good queen!

20:27.640 --> 20:28.570
This time for sure!

20:28.570 --> 20:34.060
You're making me so happy my soul is about to ascend.

20:34.820 --> 20:38.880
Keep praising me. Odessa Ei is a queen that does better the more she gets praised.

20:42.570 --> 20:43.880
Welcome home.

21:04.570 --> 21:07.070
I'm sorry, did I make you wait?

21:07.070 --> 21:10.080
If it's you, I'd even wait until my next life.

21:10.780 --> 21:13.740
You look very refreshed, Grim Reaper.

21:14.990 --> 21:19.590
You haven't seen my face in years, and you can tell that?

21:20.660 --> 21:27.700
But you are who you are, so with or without your mask,
it doesn't make much of a difference to me.

21:29.100 --> 21:32.880
I'll be away for a while again,
going on a mission to kill some monsters.

21:32.880 --> 21:34.100
Is that so?

21:34.730 --> 21:39.270
Ouka-san, as a goodbye, could you give me
the kiss we couldn't have on the Ferris wheel?

21:39.270 --> 21:40.770
Oh, um...

21:40.770 --> 21:43.110
Then I'll do it instead.

21:44.030 --> 21:45.800
You!

21:45.800 --> 21:48.690
E-E-Even I haven't kissed him yet!

21:48.690 --> 21:50.690
It's still too early for kids.

21:50.690 --> 21:51.970
Stop that, both of you.

21:51.970 --> 21:54.380
Don't you understand your position as the husband?

22:02.330 --> 22:04.440
Kyouka-sama Punch!

22:04.960 --> 22:06.710
Punch! Punch!

23:39.770 --> 23:42.650
What? It's a simply amazing ship.

23:42.650 --> 23:43.650
It looks like a pirate ship.

23:43.650 --> 23:46.020
I wonder if all pirates are well-built and handsome.

23:46.020 --> 23:47.480
I want a hug from them.

23:47.480 --> 23:49.360
I wonder if the captain is handsome.

23:49.990 --> 23:52.920
Next time: Innocent Pirate, Mujyakey
